# Private ordinary corona24 pricing source review

The ordinary game is exactly the old frozen V6 pricing source. Four engine deltas
match the isolated qualified 24-bit candidate: renderer admission, three SUB
scratch destinations, strict six paired ABS/FMAND dependencies, and TC-only
recipe/postprocessor. No observer header, pause or vblank waits enter pricing.
All normal scene effects and timing/presentation fences remain. Same ELF compares
Off/On/Off and On/Off/On with unchanged six parser dependencies. Sparse EE counters
are request witnesses only; isolated completed output and drawing pixels qualify
the candidate image, not acceptance for every ordinary quad or a hardware gain.
